  "citation": "Easterling D R; Jamason P; Bowman D P; Hughes P Y; Mason E H (2018): Daily Snow Depth Measurements from 195 Stations in the United States (1997) (NDP-059). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (USA). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/CLI.NDP059",
